-- RETIRED: consensus is derived state, not a cache that inference may delete
-- independently of testimony. Direct DELETE makes the graph disagree with its
-- surviving attestations and requires an out-of-band refold to become truthful
-- again. No caller exists; remove the executable alternate implementation while
-- preserving upgrade cleanup.
DROP FUNCTION IF EXISTS generation.prune(bigint, boolean);
DROP FUNCTION IF EXISTS laplace.laplace_prune(bigint, boolean);
